$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Yonil" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 1/4" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> A violent sand storm has caused one of five military floating bases on this world to crash with all hands lost.  In the wake of this tragedy it was discovered that the planet Yonil is going through the beginnings of a fifty year upheaval and this last storm was just the first of much worse to come!  Two of the remaining floating bases have been evacuated, leaving only two crews to be extracted.  Unfortunately, one of the transport ships dispatched to retrieve the crews has suffered mechanical faliure and was forced to stop over for emergency repairs.  To make matters worse, another storm, more violent than the last has been forecast and only the one ship will be able to make it in time to save the stranded soldiers.  That one ship can only carry one crew...\n\nKill the enemy floating base Commodore while defending your own.  The first team to kill the enemy's Commodore shall be declared the victor!";
